config DRIVERS_I2C_PAC194X
	bool
	default n
	help
	  Microchip PAC194x/PAC195x multi-channel power monitor. Probes the
	  chip at init and describes it to the OS with the Microchip ACPI
	  _HID and configuration _DSM, so the Windows EMI driver and the
	  Linux pac1944 IIO driver bind without further setup.
